This license applies to the Minecraft mod "LootLens", including its compiled files, source code where provided, assets, textures, icons, branding, documentation, and other materials distributed as part of the project.

────────────────────────────────────────
1. PERSONAL USE
────────────────────────────────────────

You are allowed to:

• Download and use LootLens for personal gameplay.
• Use LootLens in single-player worlds.
• Use LootLens on multiplayer servers where the server rules allow it.
• Make personal backup copies of the mod.
• Configure or modify the mod for your own private use.

Private modifications must not be publicly distributed without permission.

────────────────────────────────────────
2. MODPACKS
────────────────────────────────────────

LootLens may be included in free Minecraft modpacks provided that:

• The modpack does not claim ownership of LootLens.
• LootLens is credited as a separate project.
• The mod itself is not sold.
• The mod is not modified and redistributed under another name.
• A link to the official LootLens project page is provided where reasonably possible.

Commercial redistribution of LootLens as part of a paid modpack requires prior permission from the copyright holder.

────────────────────────────────────────
3. VIDEOS, STREAMS & CONTENT
────────────────────────────────────────

You are allowed to use LootLens in:

• YouTube videos
• Livestreams
• Shorts
• Tutorials
• Reviews
• Mod showcases
• Screenshots
• Social media content

Monetization of videos or streams containing LootLens is allowed.

You do not need special permission to create normal gameplay or showcase content featuring LootLens.

────────────────────────────────────────
4. REDISTRIBUTION
────────────────────────────────────────

You may NOT:

• Re-upload LootLens to another website or platform as a standalone download.
• Redistribute the original JAR file from unofficial download pages.
• Mirror the mod without permission.
• Upload LootLens to another Modrinth, CurseForge, GitHub, or similar project page as your own project.
• Claim that you created LootLens.
• Remove or replace the original author's credits.

Users should be directed to an official LootLens download page whenever possible.

────────────────────────────────────────
5. MODIFICATION & FORKS
────────────────────────────────────────

You may modify LootLens privately for personal use.

You may NOT publicly publish or distribute:

• Modified versions of LootLens
• Forks of LootLens
• Decompiled versions
• Rebranded versions
• Ports to other Minecraft versions
• Ports to other mod loaders
• Copies using LootLens code or assets

without prior permission from the copyright holder.

This includes Fabric, Forge, NeoForge, Quilt, or other loader ports.

